		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Tattered black cloak. Empty except for a toothy mouth inside the hood. Birthed when a vile being dies via an undead creature.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (1d6 + drain) or 1 control undead, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Control Undead</strong>. One mindless undead within near WIS 15+ or geist controls for 1d4 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Drain</strong>. 1d4 CON damage. Death if reduced to 0 CON.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunlight Weakness</strong>. Cannot take actions in direct sunlight, only move.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
